        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 279.69,
          "end": 281.79,
          "en": "So if the widget gets moved somewhere else,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 281.79,
          "end": 285.51,
          "en": "or if we for example, change the device orientation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 285.51,
          "end": 287.19,
          "en": "So therefore, this will be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 287.19,
          "end": 291.03,
          "en": "if the available min and max with values change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 291.03,
          "end": 293.25,
          "en": "And now we can use this width information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 293.25,
          "end": 296.94,
          "en": "in this column here in this SizedBox",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 296.94,
          "end": 299.13,
          "en": "to render the content of the column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 299.13,
          "end": 300.3,
          "en": "the widgets in that column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 300.3,
          "end": 303.6,
          "en": "so the rows of that column, conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 303.6,
          "end": 305.97,
          "en": "And we can do this by using a special syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 305.97,
          "end": 309.93,
          "en": "offered by Dart, that can be used in lists like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 309.93,
          "end": 313.17,
          "en": "where you write if, and then your condition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 313.17,
          "end": 315.6,
          "en": "for example, that the available width is greater",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 315.6,
          "end": 317.133,
          "en": "or equal than 600.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 318.54,
          "end": 322.05,
          "en": "And then in the next line, you add the item to the list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 322.05,
          "end": 324.96,
          "en": "that should be added if this condition is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 324.96,
          "end": 326.76,
          "en": "So in this case, for example, a row,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 326.76,
          "end": 329.58,
          "en": "so that we can have multiple widgets next to each other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 329.58,
          "end": 330.413,
          "en": "in this column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 331.47,
          "end": 333.42,
          "en": "And you can also add a else statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 333.42,
          "end": 336.48,
          "en": "to define which widgets should otherwise be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 336.48,
          "end": 337.383,
          "en": "to this list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 338.79,
          "end": 341.7,
          "en": "So this is a list-specific if-else syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 341.7,
          "end": 343.86,
          "en": "where you don't have curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 343.86,
          "end": 346.68,
          "en": "but instead just if with your condition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 346.68,
          "end": 349.14,
          "en": "and then the widget that is added to the list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 349.14,
          "end": 350.43,
          "en": "if the condition is met,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 350.43,
          "end": 353.283,
          "en": "and else, the widget, if the condition is not met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 354.6,
          "end": 357.45,
          "en": "So with that, we are adding a row with multiple widgets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 357.45,
          "end": 359.25,
          "en": "if we have enough space,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 359.25,
          "end": 361.77,
          "en": "and otherwise we only have a single text field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 361.77,
          "end": 363.363,
          "en": "in that first column row here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 363.363,
          "end": 365.43,
          "en": "Now, if I do have enough space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 365.43,
          "end": 368.58,
          "en": "for multiple child widgets in the first column row,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 368.58,
          "end": 370.89,
          "en": "I still wanna render my text field here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 370.89,
